rest of it.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.150
You all know about it.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:56.980
This was setting up the early stages of a
nationalistic response to Corona virus.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:00.480
Then, of course, there's always some truth
to these things.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.700
