00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.010
Then it's we're closing borders.

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:07.010
We're shutting down.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:08.660
We are isolated now.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:10.050
That was the right move.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:12.030
Every country mostly did it.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:17.231
But what we're talking about is the building
rhetoric of ultra nationalism during the corona

00:03:17.231 --> 00:03:18.830
